   "widgets_values": [
    "One unbroken take. The camera pushes in slowly and steadily, holding level, then settles into a medium framing and holds there. Light moves across the surfaces as the air stirs, loose material drifts and settles, and the background stays soft. Nothing cuts and the camera never pulls back. Audio: a quiet room tone under moving air, small close sounds near the lens, one distant bell."
